OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'out of the blue'  
OL,4,Abottle attack                          
OL,6,FAn attacker who "out of the blue"      
OL,7,Fsmashed a bottle over a stranger's head
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for three years and    
OL,9,Ffour months.                           
OL,11,FSteven Brymer, 25, left his victim with
OL,12,Fa small skull fracture and heavy       
OL,13,Fbleeding in the totally unprovoked     
OL,14,Fattack in central Newcastle in June,   
OL,15,Fthe city's crown court heard.          
OL,17,FThe victim said he had been left       
OL,18,Fterrified to go out and felt he had    
OL,19,Fbeen targeted due to not being white,  
OL,20,Falthough a judge said there was "no    
OL,21,Fevidence" of a racial motive.          
