OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'out of the blue'  
OL,4,Abottle attack                          
OL,6,FBrymer, from Newcastle, who initially  
OL,7,Ftold police he thought he had killed   
OL,8,Fhis victim, admitted wounding with     
OL,9,Fintent.                                
